def coin_change(coins, amount, n): 
    if amount == 0: 
        return 1
    if n == 0:
        return 0

    # If the nth coin is greater than the amount, then ignore the coin 
    if coins[n-1] > amount:
        return coin_change(coins, amount, n-1)

    # Count the number of solutions including the nth coin and excluding the nth coin 
    return coin_change(coins, amount-coins[n-1], n) + coin_change(coins, amount, n-1) 
```

